---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Pricing — Polis" description="Free, Pro, and Self-Hosted. Choose the plan that fits.">

<main>

<!-- Hero -->
<section class="bg-white px-6 pb-16 pt-24 md:pt-32">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
		<p class="mb-4 font-mono text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-polis-500">Pricing</p>
		<h1 class="mb-6 text-4xl font-bold leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.02em] text-slate-900 md:text-5xl">
			Free for everyone.<br />Pro for institutions.
		</h1>
		<p class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
			Polis is open source and free to use. Polis Pro adds the analytics, compliance, and support that governments and enterprises need.
		</p>
	</div>
</section>


<!-- Tier Comparison -->
<section class="border-t border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-6 py-20">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
		<div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
			<!-- Free -->
			<div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8">
				<p class="mb-1 font-mono text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">Free</p>
				<h3 class="mb-1 text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Polis 2.0</h3>
				<p class="mb-6 text-sm text-slate-500">For individuals, classrooms, and small orgs.</p>
				<p class="mb-8 text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900">$0<span class="text-base font-normal text-slate-400">/mo</span></p>
				<a href="https://pol.is" class="mb-8 block rounded-md bg-polis-700 py-3 text-center text-sm font-medium text-white no-underline transition-colors hover:bg-polis-800">Start free</a>
				<ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-600">
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="mt-0.5 text-polis-500">&#10003;</span> Unlimited conversations</li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="mt-0.5 text-polis-500">&#10003;</span> Real-time visualization</li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="mt-0.5 text-polis-500">&#10003;</span> Basic analytics</li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="mt-0.5 text-polis-500">&#10003;</span> Community support</li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="mt-0.5 text-polis-500">&#10003;</span> Embeddable on any site</li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="mt-0.5 text-polis-500">&#10003;</span> Data export (basic)</li>
				</ul>
			</div>

			<!-- Pro (featured) -->
			<div class="rounded-xl border-2 border-polis-700 bg-white p-8 shadow-md">
				<p class="mb-1 font-mono text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-polis-500">Recommended</p>
				<h3 class="mb-1 text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Polis Pro</h3>
				<p class="mb-6 text-sm text-slate-500">For governments, enterprises, and large-scale deliberation.</p>
				<p class="mb-8 text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900">Custom<span class="ml-1 text-base font-normal text-slate-400">pricing</span></p>
				<a href="/contact" class="mb-8 block rounded-md bg-polis-700 py-3 text-center text-sm font-medium text-white no-underline transition-colors hover:bg-polis-800">Contact sales</a>
				<ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-600">
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="mt-0.5 text-polis-500">&#10003;</span> Everything in Free</li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="mt-0.5 text-polis-500">&#10003;</span> Advanced analytics & export</li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="mt-0.5 text-polis-500">&#10003;</span> Custom branding & domain</li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="mt-0.5 text-polis-500">&#10003;</span> SSO / SAML integration</li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="mt-0.5 text-polis-500">&#10003;</span> GDPR & compliance tools</li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="mt-0.5 text-polis-500">&#10003;</span> Moderation dashboard</li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="mt-0.5 text-polis-500">&#10003;</span> Priority support & SLA</li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="mt-0.5 text-polis-500">&#10003;</span> Dedicated account manager</li>
				</ul>
			</div>

			<!-- Self-Hosted -->
			<div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8">
				<p class="mb-1 font-mono text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">Open Source</p>
				<h3 class="mb-1 text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900">Self-Hosted</h3>
				<p class="mb-6 text-sm text-slate-500">Run Polis on your own infrastructure. Full control.</p>
				<p class="mb-8 text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900">Free<span class="ml-1 text-base font-normal text-slate-400">/ AGPL</span></p>
				<a href="https://github.com/compdemocracy/polis" class="mb-8 block rounded-md border border-slate-300 bg-white py-3 text-center text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 no-underline transition-colors hover:bg-slate-50">View on GitHub</a>
				<ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-slate-600">
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="mt-0.5 text-polis-500">&#10003;</span> Full source code</li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="mt-0.5 text-polis-500">&#10003;</span> Docker deployment</li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="mt-0.5 text-polis-500">&#10003;</span> Community wiki & docs</li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="mt-0.5 text-polis-500">&#10003;</span> GitHub issues support</li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="mt-0.5 text-slate-300">&#10007;</span> <span class="text-slate-400">No managed hosting</span></li>
					<li class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><span class="mt-0.5 text-slate-300">&#10007;</span> <span class="text-slate-400">No formal SLA</span></li>
				</ul>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>


<!-- FAQ -->
<section class="border-t border-slate-200 bg-white px-6 py-20">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
		<div class="mb-12 text-center">
			<p class="mb-2 font-mono text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-polis-500">FAQ</p>
			<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900">Frequently asked questions</h2>
		</div>

		<div class="space-y-6">
			{[
				{ q: "Who owns the data from my Polis conversations?", a: "You do. On our hosted platform, you can export all conversation data at any time. With the self-hosted version, your data never touches our servers." },
				{ q: "Can I migrate from Free to Pro?", a: "Yes. Your conversations and data carry over. Contact us and we'll handle the transition." },
				{ q: "Is Polis Pro GDPR compliant?", a: "Yes. Polis Pro includes consent management, data residency options, right-to-deletion support, and audit logs. We can provide a Data Processing Agreement (DPA)." },
				{ q: "How does pricing work for Polis Pro?", a: "Pricing is based on your specific needs — scale, support level, and compliance requirements. Contact us for a quote tailored to your organization." },
				{ q: "What does open source mean for my deployment?", a: "Polis is licensed under AGPL-3.0. You can audit every line of code, contribute improvements, and self-host without any licensing fees." },
				{ q: "How do I get started with self-hosting?", a: "Clone the repository, follow the Docker setup guide, and you'll have a running instance in minutes. The community wiki has detailed documentation." },
			].map(({ q, a }) => (
				<div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6">
					<h4 class="mb-2 text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">{q}</h4>
					<p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">{a}</p>
				</div>
			))}
		</div>
	</div>
</section>


<!-- CTA -->
<section class="border-t border-slate-200 bg-polis-500 px-6 py-16 text-center">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
		<h2 class="mb-4 font-display text-3xl font-bold text-white">Ready to hear what people really think?</h2>
		<p class="mb-8 text-lg text-polis-100">Start a Polis conversation in minutes. Free, open source, no account required.</p>
		<div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-4 sm:flex-row">
			<a href="https://pol.is" class="rounded-md bg-white px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-polis-600 no-underline shadow-sm transition-colors hover:bg-polis-50">Start a conversation</a>
			<a href="/contact" class="rounded-md border border-polis-300 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-white no-underline transition-colors hover:bg-polis-600">Talk to sales &rarr;</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

</main>

</Layout>
